</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Goto</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Sato</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Fujibuchi</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Bono</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Kanehisa</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>KEGG: Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res</source><year>1999</year><volume>27</volume><fpage>29</fpage><lpage>34</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/nar/27.1.29</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Ogata H, Goto S, Sato K, Fujibuchi W, Bono H, Kanehisa M (1999) KEGG: Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes. Nucleic Acids Res 27:29&#x02013;34 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9847135</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR10"><label>10.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pico</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>Kelder</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Iersel</surname><given-names>MP</given-names></name><name><surname>Hanspers</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Conklin</surname><given-names>BR</given-names></name><name><surname>Evelo</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>WikiPathways: pathway editing for the people</article-title><source>PLoS Biol</source><year>2008</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>e184</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1371/journal.pbio.0060184</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Pico AR, Kelder T, van Iersel MP, Hanspers K, Conklin BR, Evelo C (2008) WikiPathways: pathway editing for the people. PLoS Biol 6:e184 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18651794</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Iersel</surname><given-names>MP</given-names></name><name><surname>Kelder</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Pico</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>Hanspers</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Coort</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Conklin</surname><given-names>BR</given-names></name><name><surname>Evelo</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Presenting and exploring biological pathways with PathVisio</article-title><source>BMC Bioinformatics</source><year>2008</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>399</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1471-2105-9-399</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">van Iersel MP, Kelder T, Pico AR, Hanspers K, Coort S, Conklin BR, Evelo C (2008) Presenting and exploring biological pathways with PathVisio. BMC Bioinformatics 9:399 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18817533</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR12"><label>12.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Waldrop</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Big data: wikiomics</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>2008</year><volume>455</volume><fpage>22</fpage><lpage>25</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/455022a</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Waldrop M (2008) Big data: wikiomics. Nature 455:22&#x02013;25 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18769412</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>